1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
We suffer more in imagination than in reality.

2
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,760
We live inside our heads all the time.

3
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,460
It doesn't matter what the reality actually is.

4
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,020
The problem is, we overthink everything.

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,960
Most of our pain doesn't come from what happens,

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,920
but from what we imagine might happen.
